      <h2 id="ztp-updating-gitops-ztp_ztp-updating-gitops" class="group scroll-mt-20">Overview of the GitOps ZTP update process<a href="#ztp-updating-gitops-ztp_ztp-updating-gitops" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
